# server/ holds host-specific deployment files — systemd units with User=gregor
# and EnvironmentFile=%h/config/nightshift.env, plus the runner referencing
# /root/.config/cos.env. The root repo is PUBLIC and its pre-push guard blocks
# .datacore/modules/*/server/ for exactly this reason. Kept out of git here so
# the exclusion is stated at the module rather than discovered at push time.
#
# Consequence to be aware of: triage-github.sh is therefore NOT versioned. Its
# 2026-08-10 fix (scan failures no longer reported as an empty result) lives
# only on this Mac, winston and nightshift.
server/

data/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
